5... Nf6 $2 { Develops a piece but ignores the threat of a5. } 6. a5 { Attacks the bishop, which has no safe square: a7 is blocked by its own pawn and c5 is covered by the b-pawn. } 6... Bxf2+ { Black gets a pawn for the piece at best. } 7. Kxf2 Nxe4+ 8. Kg1 d5 *
